ReCoF license
=============

ReCoF is built on the source of DeCoF (https://github.com/caixax/DeCoF) and
keeps DeCoF's license in parts 1 to 3. Part 4 covers the code written for
ReCoF. The repository holds these kinds of material, each under its own
terms.


1. Tools and documentation written for DeCoF and ReCoF
------------------------------------------------------

The scripts in tools/ (except the data in tools/symbols/), the files in
tools/dist_extra/, the documentation in docs/ (except the tables of retail
names and addresses named in part 3), README.md, objdiff.json and
tools/units.json are under the MIT License:

    MIT License

    Copyright (c) 2026 caixax

